Package: phdlab
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv
Maintainer: PhD Research Lab <noreply@phdlab.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/Duy-Huan/PhD-Research-Lab
Description: PhD Research Lab - local research workspace
 Literature, experiments, writing and AI agents for one research project at a
 time. Research data stays in ~/.local/share/phdlab and in the project folders
 you choose; removing the package never deletes it.
